  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Fish the pools and open water here until skill 125, about 120 catches: from 75 a catch raises the skill less often (about one in two by 100, one in three by 125). Pools (floating wreckage, schools of fish) also give extra loot. Nightcrawlers (+50 from skill 50, 1s each) are twice as strong as a Shiny Bauble. The Strong Fishing Pole (+5 from skill 10, 9s 1c) is in limited stock at fishing vendors: buy it when you see it. Fish get away here below skill 75; a lure on the pole adds to your skill for ten minutes and closes the gap. To cook what you catch: Recipe: Longjaw Mud Snapper for the Raw Longjaw Mud Snapper of lakes and rivers (Cooking 50, 4s: Khara Deepwater (Loch Modan) or Tansy Puddlefizz (Ironforge)); Recipe: Rainbow Fin Albacore for the Raw Rainbow Fin Albacore of the coast (Cooking 50, 4s: Stuart Fleming (Wetlands) or Gritta Chumwater (Riverglades)).
  goto 41.6,37.8 "The Loch" r 25
  buy 6328 x1 npc 1684 optional
