step Fishing: Darkshore (50-125)
  only NightElf
  zone Darkshore
  tip Fish the pools and open water here until skill 125, about 120 catches: from 75 a catch raises the skill less often (about one in two by 100, one in three by 125). Pools (floating wreckage, schools of fish) also give extra loot. Nightcrawlers (+50 from skill 50, 1s each) are twice as strong as a Shiny Bauble. The Strong Fishing Pole (+5 from skill 10, 9s 1c) is in limited stock at fishing vendors: buy it when you see it. Fish get away here below skill 75; a lure on the pole adds to your skill for ten minutes and closes the gap. To cook what you catch: Recipe: Longjaw Mud Snapper for the Raw Longjaw Mud Snapper of lakes and rivers (Cooking 50, 4s: Nyoma (Teldrassil)); Recipe: Rainbow Fin Albacore for the Raw Rainbow Fin Albacore of the coast (Cooking 50, 4s: Heldan Galesong (Darkshore) or Nessa Shadowsong (Teldrassil)). Darkshore Grouper bites only here: eat it as it is. Gubber Blump (Darkshore) takes 6 for The Family and the Fishing Pole, which gives the Blump Family Fishing Pole. Oily Blackmouth from the schools here is no food: alchemists make Blackmouth Oil from it (Alchemy 80); keep it to sell or trade.
  goto 34.6,42.9 "Darkshore coast" r 25
