# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Expert Fishing
section Fishing 125-225

step Expert Fishing
  tip Expert Fishing (cap 225) is a book, not a trainer rank: Old Man Heming sells Expert Fishing - The Bass and You (1g) on the lowest dock of Booty Bay, at the south tip of Stranglethorn Vale, to both factions. Buy it and read it; it needs skill 125 and level 20. At level 20 the safe way in is the boat from Ratchet in The Barrens, not the road through Stranglethorn. He also sells Bright Baubles (+75 from skill 100, 2s 50c each), the lure for the rest of the way.
  level 20
  train Fishing Expert "Buy and read Expert Fishing - The Bass and You (Expert Fishing)"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Fishing 125-225

step Fishing: Wetlands (125-225)
  only Human,Dwarf,Gnome,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Wetlands
  tip Fish the pools here until skill 225, about 500 catches: one in three raises the skill at 125, one in seven by 225, so this is the long stretch. Forever's second camping item, the Fishing Rack (from skill 140), is a blueprint that drops from Gelihast in Blackfathom Deeps. Fish get away here below skill 150; a lure on the pole adds to your skill for ten minutes and closes the gap. To cook what you catch: Recipe: Bristle Whisker Catfish for the Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish of lakes and rivers (Cooking 100, 12s: Lindea Rabonne (Hillsbrad Foothills) or Catherine Leland (Stormwind City)); Recipe: Rockscale Cod for the Raw Rockscale Cod of the coast (Cooking 175, 22s: Stuart Fleming (Wetlands) or Tansy Puddlefizz (Ironforge)). Oily Blackmouth from the schools here is no food: alchemists make Blackmouth Oil from it (Alchemy 80); keep it to sell or trade.
  goto 10.8,63.1 "Wetlands coast" r 25
  skill Fishing 225

