# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Artisan Fishing: Nat Pagle
section Fishing 225-300

step Nat Pagle, Angler Extreme
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  tip Artisan Fishing (cap 300) comes from Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh. The fishing trainer in Ironforge sends you to him; the quest needs skill 225 and level 35.
  skill Fishing 225
  level 35
  accept 6609                             -- Grimnur Stonebrand, Ironforge

step Nat Pagle, Angler Extreme
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Artisan Fishing (cap 300) comes from Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh. The fishing trainer in Orgrimmar sends you to him; the quest needs skill 225 and level 35.
  skill Fishing 225
  level 35
  accept 6608                             -- Lumak, Orgrimmar

step Nat Pagle
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Nat Pagle fishes from the shore of a small island off the east coast, south of Theramore; swim over from the coast.
  turnin 6609 only Alliance
  turnin 6608 only Horde
  accept 6607

step Sar'theris Striker
  only Alliance
  zone Desolace
  tip Fish along the coast of Desolace (Sar'theris Strand in the north-west, or the shore west of Shadowprey Village) until you catch a Sar'theris Striker: about one catch in five there brings it up, and it bites nowhere else. At skill 225 nothing gets away here.
  collect 16968 quest 6607 @39.5,22.7

step Sar'theris Striker
  only Horde
  zone Desolace
  tip Fish along the coast of Desolace (Sar'theris Strand in the north-west, or the shore west of Shadowprey Village) until you catch a Sar'theris Striker: about one catch in five there brings it up, and it bites nowhere else. At skill 225 nothing gets away here.
  collect 16968 quest 6607 @22.8,76.8

step Feralas Ahi
  zone Feralas
  tip Fish along the Verdantis River in Feralas (south-east of Dire Maul) until you catch a Feralas Ahi: about one catch in five there brings it up, and it bites nowhere else. This water loses fish below skill 300: at 225 most get away, so put Bright Baubles (+75) on the pole first.
  buy 6532 x2 nearest
  collect 16967 quest 6607 @63.7,53.1

step Savage Coast Blue Sailfin
  only Alliance
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Fish along Stranglethorn Vale's Savage Coast (the west shore) until you catch a Savage Coast Blue Sailfin: about one catch in five there brings it up, and it bites nowhere else. At skill 225 nothing gets away here.
  collect 16969 quest 6607 @27.4,68.9

